      "message": "fix(2d): name stock bands in narrow-tool refusals\n\nAdd stock-source context to the existing 2D clearing refusal.\nName controlled rectangular side margins, tool size and stock to leave.\nKeep other refusal messages and generated paths unchanged.\nPin the plate reproduction, boundary changes, leave, units and curved fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nFixes #3791",
