        "date": "2026-11-24T03:26:14Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): keep the pocket refusal for a closed pocket on a stock source\n\nThe stock-band refusal named any stock-source area that the cutter\ncould not fit. A closed pocket in a part whose outline equals the stock\noutline got the band message and the 2D Contour advice (PR #3805\nreview).\n\nName the band only when a piece of the stock-minus-part region has a\nloop of the stock outline as its outer loop and kept material inside\nthat loop. A closed pocket and a pocket around an island keep the\ngenerator's own refusal.\n\nRefs #3791\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
